+```markdown
+| `{\cal U}_c` | unitary center Fourier transform from the ordered two-magnon chamber `ℓ²(ℤ×ℕ)` to `∫^⊕dK\,ℓ²(ℕ)`; the subscript distinguishes it from `U[f]` (D3) and `𝒰(g)` (D2) | theory/ml2-completeness.md (15) |
+```
